  +  filing
    '  What a gateway observed for this world (a mail read, a form
    '  sent), filed as this world's own answer: each observation at
    '  <watch>/<asker>/<name> written as it came at
    '  /our/<asker>/<name> (made: the answer is new the first time).
    \  b=bowl cur=myth r=row[dep]
    ^  yell
    =  view b.crew.gut(['watch] (axal/new[myth] .none))
    =  es view.tap
    =  our=path ['our]
    =  ours b.here.take(1).weld(our)
    %  i=nat 0  cards=row[[p=path q=writ]] []
    ^  yell
    ?  (ge i es.len)  (yell cards cur)
    =  [p t] es.at(i)
    ?  (ge p.len 2)  (_ i.inc cards.snoc([ours.weld(p) (writ/make t)]))
    (_ i.inc cards)
